---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="box skills">
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="map-trifold" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<p class="ability">Ability 01</p>
		<h2>Level &amp; Systems Design</h2>
		<p>
			Mall layouts sketched for skate lines, character-swap puzzles, and resource loops where fuel is
			both the timer and the win condition.
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="bug-beetle" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<p class="ability">Ability 02</p>
		<h2>QA Vision</h2>
		<p>
			As a Staff Test Analyst at Blizzard, I break games for a living. I design with edge cases,
			readability, and the player's first five minutes in mind.
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="hourglass-high" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<p class="ability">Ability 03</p>
		<h2>Ships on a Deadline</h2>
		<p>
			Seven game jams, solo and with teams of up to nine: scoping, producing, and delivering playable
			games in days.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.box {
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background-color: var(--gray-999_40);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
	}

	.skills {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.skills h2 {
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
	}

	.skills p {
		color: var(--gray-400);
	}

	.skills .ability {
		font-family: var(--font-brand);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--link-color);
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.box {
			border-radius: 1.5rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
		}

		.skills {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 5rem;
		}

		.skills h2 {
			font-size: var(--text-2xl);
		}
	}
</style>
